{"id":"torrey:atonement-the-day-of","source":"torrey","name":"Atonement, The Day Of","slug":"atonement-the-day-of","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Tenth day of seventh month — Le 23:26,27.","refs":[["Lev",23,26,23,26],["Lev",23,27,23,27]]},{"text":"A day of humiliation — Le 16:29,31; 23:27.","refs":[["Lev",16,29,16,29],["Lev",16,31,16,31],["Lev",23,27,23,27]]},{"text":"Observed as a sabbath — Le 23:28,32.","refs":[["Lev",23,28,23,28],["Lev",23,32,23,32]]},{"text":"Offerings to be made on — Le 16:3,5-15.","refs":[["Lev",16,3,16,3],["Lev",16,5,16,15]]},{"text":"The high priest entered into the holy place on — Le 16:2,3; Heb 9:7.","refs":[["Lev",16,2,16,2],["Lev",16,3,16,3],["Heb",9,7,9,7]]},{"text":"For the holy place. — Ex 30:10; Le 16:15,16.","refs":[["Exod",30,10,30,10],["Lev",16,15,16,15],["Lev",16,16,16,16]]},{"text":"For the high priest. — Le 16:11; Heb 9:7.","refs":[["Lev",16,11,16,11],["Heb",9,7,9,7]]},{"text":"For the whole congregation. — Le 16:17,24; 23:28; Heb 9:7.","refs":[["Lev",16,17,16,17],["Lev",16,24,16,24],["Lev",23,28,23,28],["Heb",9,7,9,7]]},{"text":"The sins of the people borne off by the scapegoat on — Le 16:21.","refs":[["Lev",16,21,16,21]]},{"text":"Punishment for not observing — Le 23:29,30.","refs":[["Lev",23,29,23,29],["Lev",23,30,23,30]]},{"text":"Year of Jubilee commenced on — Le 25:9.","refs":[["Lev",25,9,25,9]]},{"text":"Typical — Heb 9:8,24.","refs":[["Heb",9,8,9,8],["Heb",9,24,9,24]]}],"refCount":27}
